156
00:19:39,760 --> 00:19:41,360
Now we can try ridge regression.

157
00:19:45,440 --> 00:19:51,840
Let us start with a value of 0.5.

158
00:19:56,800 --> 00:20:02,000
However to compare this result we should apply linear regression on the normalized

159
00:20:02,000 --> 00:20:06,240
