167
00:21:03,360 --> 00:21:06,880
By trying out different values of the regularization parameter, we can

168
00:21:06,880 --> 00:21:12,480
attempt to improve on the performance. However trying out parameters manually is not feasible

169
00:21:13,280 --> 00:21:29,840
for this. We will use a meta learning algorithm called CV parameter selection.

170
00:21:32,240 --> 00:21:37,520
Essentially CV parameter selection will take as input a learning algorithm, a parameter of

171
00:21:37,520 --> 00:21:44,800
that algorithm and a range of values to try out for that parameter. Let us specify this,

172
00:21:45,920 --> 00:21:49,600
so first we select the algorithm which is linear regression.

173
00:21:55,520 --> 00:22:05,120
